, extended magazines, and unique skins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/1dc0ad4f1c26fa34ff909b6a1976263a.poster.avif?t=1770134832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/1dc0ad4f1c26fa34ff909b6a1976263a.webm?t=1770134832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/1dc0ad4f1c26fa34ff909b6a1976263a.mp4?t=1770134832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Visual Overhaul:</strong> Experience a more immersive world with dynamic weather, improved lighting, and brand-new 3D models. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Refined:</strong> With completely overhauled animations, both gunplay and melee combat feel more fluid and impactful than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/659a90e1416e5a8dba5b127094b0b98b.poster.avif?t=1770134832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/659a90e1416e5a8dba5b127094b0b98b.webm?t=1770134832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/659a90e1416e5a8dba5b127094b0b98b.mp4?t=1770134832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Map &amp; Secrets:</strong> Explore a