ore_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/b5f17e4cfd30bf8027db40de0b76bc49.mp4?t=1770134832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons differ in fire rate, range, damage, penetration, and recoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Black-Market Dealer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/7a7b4a7b04f39226ea6389009dbdca9a.avif?t=1770134832\" width=626 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find him hidden in the shadows to buy gear and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/bc942b429c11614c691d22fcfd5c4393.avif?t=1770134832\" width=626 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Boss has unique mechanics and enhanced attributes. You'll need a strategy to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character &amp; Weapon Boosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234260/extras/d10b1074579871d6b5ee59a43c0d1a87.avif?t=1770134832\" width=626 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use vending machines to enhance your health regeneration or weapon skills (e.g., magazine size).</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE:</strong> Deadly Land is currently undergoing a massive overhaul. The &quot;<strong>Rebirth Update</strong>&quot; (2.0) described below is in active development and represents the future of the game. By purchasing now, you directly support a solo developer in completing this vision. You will get immediate access to the <strong>Classic Version</strong>,